==History==
2016
*The Prince [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 11/1/2016, the [[Version History#The First Update (11/1/2016)|First Update]], decreased the Prince's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Prince's sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles). It also changed the Prince's sound effects.
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Prince's charge speed to 120 (from 138).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Prince's range to 1.85 tiles (from 2.5 tiles), now classified as Melee, but his effective range remained unchanged. It also made a small change to the Prince's card description.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Prince's damage by 9%.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Prince's damage by 2%. This means that a Level 13 Prince will now be able to defeat Level 13 [[Barbarians]] in 2 hits or 1 charge strike.
2017
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], increased the Prince’s hitpoints by 5% and decreased his attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 3.5 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Prince's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
*On 12/12/2018, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(12/12/2018)|Optional Update]], fixed an issue where the Prince's [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Dark Prince]].
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Prince's range to 1.6 tiles (from 1.85 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Prince's card info screen.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Prince's hitpoints by 3%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Prince from [[Training Camp]] to Royal Arena.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Prince's hitpoints by 4% and made him able to jump over the river.
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the distance required for charging to 3 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the distance required for charging to 1.5 tiles (from 3 tiles).
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 2 tiles (from 1.5 tiles).
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Prince's damage by 0.25% and his charge damage by 0.12%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles).

